@startuml deployment-docker
title Sơ Đồ Triển Khai Docker Compose (Deployment Architecture)
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

skinparam node {
    BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
    BorderColor #2D3748
}

skinparam component {
    BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
    BorderColor #3182CE
}

skinparam database {
    BackgroundColor #EDF2F7
    BorderColor #2B6CB0
}

actor "Người dùng / Trình duyệt\n(Client Web Browser)" as User

node "Host Machine (Docker Engine)" as Host {
    
    node "Docker Network: default (Bridge Network)" as Net {

        ' Container Frontend
        node "Container: brewlite_frontend" as FrontendContainer {
            artifact "Frontend Image\n(Build: ./frontend/Dockerfile)" as FE_Image
            component "Next.js 14/15 Production Server\n(Port: 3000)" as NextServer
            
            note bottom of NextServer
                **Build Arguments & Env:**
                * NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
                * NEXT_PUBLIC_DEMO_MODE = true
                * restart: always
            end note
        }

        ' Container Backend
        node "Container: brewlite_backend" as BackendContainer {
            artifact "Backend Image\n(Build: ./backend/Dockerfile)" as BE_Image
            component "NestJS Application Server\n(Port: 4000)" as NestServer
            
            note bottom of NestServer
                **Biến môi trường (Environment):**
                * PORT = 4000
                * NODE_ENV = development / production
                * DATABASE_URL = postgresql://brewlite_admin:...@postgres:5432/brewlite_db?schema=public
                * DIRECT_URL = postgresql://brewlite_admin:...@postgres:5432/brewlite_db?schema=public
                * JWT_SECRET = brewlite_super_secret_jwt_key_2026
                * JWT_EXPIRATION = 7d
                * restart: always
                * **Startup Command:**
                  npx prisma migrate deploy && node dist/main
            end note
        }

        ' Container Postgres
        node "Container: brewlite_postgres" as PostgresContainer {
            artifact "PostgreSQL Image\n(postgres:16-alpine)" as PG_Image
            database "PostgreSQL Database Engine\n(Port: 5432)" as PG_Engine
            
            note bottom of PG_Engine
                **Biến môi trường (Environment):**
                * POSTGRES_USER = brewlite_admin
                * POSTGRES_PASSWORD = brewlite_secret_pass
                * POSTGRES_DB = brewlite_db
                * restart: always
                * **Healthcheck:**
                  pg_isready -U brewlite_admin -d brewlite_db
                  (interval: 5s, timeout: 5s, retries: 5)
            end note
        }
    }

    storage "Docker Named Volume:\nbrewlite_postgres_data" as PG_Vol {
        folder "/var/lib/postgresql/data" as PG_Data
    }
}

' Liên kết ánh xạ cổng từ Host vào Container
User --> NextServer : HTTP: 3000\n(Host 3000:3000)
User --> NestServer : HTTP REST API: 4000\n(Host 4000:4000)

' Quan hệ phụ thuộc và giao tiếp nội bộ giữa các container trong mạng Docker
NextServer ..> NestServer : depends_on: [backend]\nGọi API: http://backend:4000 hoặc localhost:4000
NestServer --> PG_Engine : depends_on: postgres (service_healthy)\nTCP: 5432 (Internal Host: postgres:5432)
PG_Engine --> PG_Data : Ghi dữ liệu bền vững (Persist Volume)

@enduml